# Build outputs: regenerated by the tools, not part of the sources.  Files generated by Quartus
# (databases, reports, netlists, timing and programming files) also carry the tool vendor's terms.

# Verilator builds and simulation outputs
tb/obj_*/
tb/obj_*.log
tb/out/
tb/build_*.log
gls/verilator/obj_*/
gls/verilator/*.vo
gls/verilator/*.ppm
gls/verilator/verilate_*.log
gls/icarus/db/
gls/icarus/*.bin
gls/icarus/*.ppm
gls/icarus/*.log

# Quartus
quartus/*/db/
quartus/*/incremental_db/
quartus/*/simulation/
quartus/*/output_files/
quartus/*/*.log
quartus/*/*.qws
quartus/*/*.rpt
quartus/*/sta_paths.txt
quartus/*/compile_log.txt
quartus/*/pow_log.txt
quartus/*/qsf.bak
quartus/*.log

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Comparison decoders (bench/others): fetched sources live outside, their builds are outputs
bench/others/obj_*/
bench/others/quartus/cmp*/

# Tool logs (outputs of builds and runs; the *.txt result files cited by the docs are kept)
*.log

# Images: test images, golden decodes and simulation outputs are not published here.  The test
# corpus (tb/corpus, tb/malformed) is regenerated by scripts/make_corpus.py and
# tb/make_malformed.py from the owner's photos (provenance: tb/corpus/SOURCES.md); the golden
# files are regenerated by tb/run_tests.py from model/jpeg_golden.py.
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.png
*.ppm
*.pnm
*.pgm
*.bmp
tb/golden_legacy/

# Local only, never published: the review of the owner's original 2022-23 code
REVIEW.md
